---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Solutions
metaTitle: "Analytical Solutions for Food, Dairy and Feed Testing | Acurris Analytical"
description: "Analytical solutions for food testing labs, dairy processors and feed and poultry operations in India. Rapid screening kits, sample prep and technical support."
pageType: solutions
---

{%- set solutionPages = [
  {
    slug: "food-testing-labs",
    title: "Food testing labs",
    intro: "Kits and sample preparation for NABL-accredited and private food testing labs, matched to the methods on your scope.",
    image: "cat-quechers",
    products: ["QuEChERS","dSPE","SPE","Filtration","Mycotoxins"],
    url: "/solutions/food-testing-labs/"
  },
  {
    slug: "dairy",
    title: "Dairy processors",
    intro: "Test panels your collection staff can run on every tanker and every can, without a lab.",
    image: "cat-antibiotic-residues",
    products: ["Antibiotic residues","Food adulteration","Mycotoxins","Sample handling"],
    url: "/solutions/dairy/"
  },
  {
    slug: "feed-and-poultry",
    title: "Feed and poultry",
    intro: "Rapid kits and sampling guidance for feed mills and poultry integrators testing maize, DDGS, oilcake and finished feed.",
    image: "cat-mycotoxins",
    products: ["Mycotoxins","SPE","Sample handling"],
    url: "/solutions/feed-and-poultry/"
  }
] %}

<section class="solutions-hero science-surface">
  {% set scienceFieldVariant = "science-field--solutions" %}
  {% include "partials/science-field.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap solutions-hero-grid">
    <div class="solutions-hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">ANALYTICAL SOLUTIONS</p>
      <h1>Solutions Built Around Real Analytical Challenges</h1>
      <p class="lead">Acurris helps laboratories and analytical workflows select the right products for real-world applications.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#solutions-discovery">Explore Solutions</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/request-quote/">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Solution support highlights">
        <div class="trust-item">
          <strong>Method-fit selection</strong>
          <span>Matched to the way your lab actually works</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <strong>Fast technical reply</strong>
          <span>We answer within {{ site.supportHours }} hours</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <strong>Evaluation packs</strong>
          <span>Test before you scale up</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <strong>Practical guidance</strong>
          <span>Sampling and setup support built in</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="solutions-hero-visual">
      <div class="solutions-hero-stage">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-quechers-l.webp" srcset="/assets/img/products/cat-quechers-m.webp 600w, /assets/img/products/cat-quechers-l.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="Analytical sample preparation and testing workflow" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <div class="solutions-hero-panel">
        <p class="kicker">Featured workflow</p>
        <strong>Food testing labs</strong>
        <p>One supplier for your whole analyte panel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="solutions-discovery" aria-labelledby="solutions-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Application areas</p>
        <h2 id="solutions-title">Solutions for real-world analytical workflows</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="solutions-grid">
      {% for solution in solutionPages %}
      <article class="solutions-card">
        <a class="solutions-card-media" href="{{ solution.url }}" aria-label="Explore {{ solution.title }}">
          <img src="/assets/img/products/{{ solution.image }}-m.webp" width="800" height="620" alt="{{ solution.title }} solution" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        <div class="solutions-card-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Solution</p>
          <h3><a href="{{ solution.url }}">{{ solution.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ solution.intro }}</p>
          <ul class="solutions-card-list">
            {% for item in solution.products %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="{{ solution.url }}">Explore solution {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section solutions-application-section" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="solutions-application-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Challenge to solution</p>
      <h2 id="challenge-title">From analytical challenge to the right product.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="solutions-application-grid">
      <article class="solutions-focus solutions-focus--large">
        <div class="solutions-focus-kicker mono">Challenge</div>
        <h3>Food testing labs need one reliable supply chain across many analytes.</h3>
        <p>As food testing capacity expands, labs need consumables and kits that match their validated methods without extra import delays or multiple suppliers.</p>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/solutions/food-testing-labs/">Explore food testing labs {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      </article>

      <article class="solutions-focus">
        <div class="solutions-focus-kicker mono">Solution</div>
        <h3>Dairy processors</h3>
        <p>Rapid intake screening for antibiotic residues, adulteration and mycotoxin risks before pooled milk moves downstream.</p>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/solutions/dairy/">Explore dairy {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      </article>

      <article class="solutions-focus">
        <div class="solutions-focus-kicker mono">Products</div>
        <h3>Relevant categories</h3>
        <ul class="solutions-focus-list">
          <li><a href="/products/quechers/">QuEChERS</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/dspe/">dSPE</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/filtration/">Filtration</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/mycotoxins/">Mycotoxins</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="support-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Acurris</p>
        <h2 id="support-title">Practical support for the way your team works</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="solutions-support-grid">
      <div class="solutions-support-item">
        <span class="mono">01</span>
        <h3>Method-first recommendations</h3>
        <p>We help match products to your laboratory scope, matrix and workflow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solutions-support-item">
        <span class="mono">02</span>
        <h3>Technical response</h3>
        <p>Questions are answered within {{ site.supportHours }} hours, with practical guidance for sample handling and setup.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solutions-support-item">
        <span class="mono">03</span>
        <h3>Evaluation packs</h3>
        <p>Use a paid evaluation pack on your own samples before committing to a larger order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solutions-support-item">
        <span class="mono">04</span>
        <h3>Sample prep guidance</h3>
        <p>From extraction and cleanup to collection-point screening, we support the full workflow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section solutions-final-cta science-surface" aria-labelledby="solutions-cta-title">
  {% set scienceFieldVariant = "science-field--dark" %}
  {% include "partials/science-field.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap solutions-final-cta-content">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Need help finding the right analytical solution?</p>
      <h2 id="solutions-cta-title">Need help finding the right analytical solution?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row solutions-final-cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/products/">Explore Products</a>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/request-quote/">Request a Quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
